,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">李彦宏:AI变革不只是技术革命，企业需要围绕智能体重构组织</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Runway开源27B世界动作模型Praxis-1，登顶机器人权威榜单并支持商业化</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic为Claude API新增effort参数，支持对话中动态调节模型推理强度</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里发布千问大模型 Qwen4，千问 App 同步接入预览版</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d1a48292d65fb5bbe0b78183b1b15486.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里正式宣布推出全新一代千问大模型 Qwen4，该模型在底层架构与核心能力上实现显著进化。Qwen4 在知识理解、世界感知、代码编写、逻辑推理及自动化智能体（Agent）执行表现上均有大幅提升，能够更高效地处理复杂上下文与多模态信息。配合此次官宣，千问 App 已同步接入 Qwen4-Max 预览版，用户现可直接在 App 内体验新模型在日常对话与复杂任务处理中的性能表现。此次迭代标志着千问系列在模型底层架构上的重大升级，旨在通过增强的语义解析与多模态建模能力，进一步提升大模型在实际应用场景中的落地效果，为开发者与用户提供更强大的智能交互支持。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度发布ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview模型，将于11月25日前正式开源权重</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f5eade8585a31c487191397abb5a32ba.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度正式发布文心大模型ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview，该模型作为Base版本的后训练版本，采用280B总参数与14B激活参数的混合架构，支持高达1M的超长上下文窗口。目前，该模型的API接口已在百度千帆平台上线，供开发者进行调用测试。在应用层面，ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview重点展示了其在游戏开发、3D建模、知识工作及视频创作等复杂工作流中的Agent智能体协同能力。百度官方明确，该版本为后训练阶段的中间产物，研发团队将持续根据反馈进行算法优化。此外，百度承诺将于11月25日前正式开源该模型的权重，旨在进一步推动国内人工智能开源生态的发展，为开发者提供更具性能优势的底层模型支持。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">李彦宏:AI变革不只是技术革命，企业需要围绕智能体重构组织</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7bd0eb34c3886282f6d1a52bf44fd347.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">李彦宏:AI变革不只是技术革命，企业需要围绕智能体重构组织AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Nov 12, 20262811月12日，在2026百度世界大会上，百度创始人李彦宏提出，人工智能不仅是一场技术革命，更是一场组织革命，未来十年，智能组织将成为AI时代的“新厂房”。李彦宏回顾了过去十年AI产业的发展。2016年，他曾将人工智能定义为“新的电脑”。经过十年演进，AI已形成完整的技术体系，构建起以GPU为核心，涵盖芯片、云基础设施、模型层以及以智能体为核心的应用层的全新技术栈。在这一体系中，如果能源是AI产业的上游，组织能力则构成产业下游的重要环节。李彦宏认为，仅将AI作为员工个人工具，已不足以释放其生产力价值。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Runway开源27B世界动作模型Praxis-1，登顶机器人权威榜单并支持商业化</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9d67364595409ee9f6582ed6467d4d18.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Runway正式开源270亿参数的世界动作模型Praxis-1，采用Apache 2.0许可，全面开放模型权重、推理及微调代码。该模型采用MoE Diffusion Transformer架构，核心优势在于能同时预测视频与动作。在NVIDIA RoboLab-120基准测试中，Praxis-1以46.2%的成功率登顶榜首，超越FLUX3Action等竞品。在迁移泛化测试中，其在Google RT-1机器人上的成功率达80.0%。硬件适配方面，Praxis-1支持从H100、B200数据中心GPU到RTX 5090工作站显卡，以及Jetson Thor边缘端侧芯片。开发者可通过GitHub和Hugging Face获取模型，并支持vLLM-Omni推理及LoRA微调。Runway表示，此举旨在提升物理AI的互操作</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic为Claude API新增effort参数，支持对话中动态调节模型推理强度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b71cbb1ef0b58e51f834cbf694c2fb5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于11月12日为Claude API推出Beta版effort参数，允许开发者在同一对话流中动态调整模型的推理投入程度。该功能通过在消息序列中插入包含output_config.effort配置的空白system消息实现，无需重开会话或重置提示词缓存。该参数从下一条用户消息起生效，支持开发者根据任务复杂度实时切换模型档位。在轻量问答场景下可降低Token消耗与响应延迟，在复杂推理或工具调用环节则可提升回答深度。此机制对长链路智能体（Agent）开发尤为关键，开发者可根据检索与推理需求精准分配算力，在回答质量、响应速度与API调用成本之间实现精细化平衡，从而优化整体运营效率。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
